{"judgments": [
 {"clause_id": "c001", "issues": [
   {"issue": "\"Securities\" is defined to mean \"securities or other assets,\" a catch-all with no boundary on what assets may be made the subject of a Transaction. The same sentence makes the Agreement govern \"unless otherwise agreed in writing,\" leaving open what writing suffices to displace it.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.16}
 ]},
 {"clause_id": "c002", "issues": [
   {"issue": "The definition of \"Act of Insolvency\" ends each list with catch-alls — \"or similar law,\" \"or similar official,\" \"an order having a similar effect\" — whose reach beyond the enumerated proceedings is undefined. A court could be asked whether a foreign or non-judicial proceeding is a \"similar law\" proceeding.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.12}
 ]},
 {"clause_id": "c003", "issues": [
   {"issue": "\"Additional Purchased Securities\" is limited to Securities provided under Paragraph 4(a), but Paragraph 4(a) permits the margin call to be met with cash, and Paragraph 2(p) then folds only Additional Purchased Securities into \"Purchased Securities.\" The status of margin cash under the Purchased Securities definitions is left unresolved.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.13}
 ]},
 {"clause_id": "c004", "issues": []},
 {"clause_id": "c005", "issues": [
   {"issue": "The Buyer's Margin Percentage is whatever percentage is \"agreed to by Buyer and Seller,\" with no requirement that the agreement be in writing or in a Confirmation, and only a formula fallback in the absence of agreement. Whether a percentage set in a Confirmation or by course of dealing can be changed unilaterally is left open.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.11}
 ]},
 {"clause_id": "c006", "issues": []},
 {"clause_id": "c007", "issues": [
   {"issue": "\"Income\" sweeps in \"any principal thereof\" together with \"other distributions,\" an unbounded catch-all after two enumerated specifics (interest, dividends). Whether principal paydowns on mortgage-backed Securities are \"Income\" payable to Seller under Paragraph 5 turns on this term.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.18}
 ]},
 {"clause_id": "c008", "issues": []},
 {"clause_id": "c009", "issues": []},
 {"clause_id": "c010", "issues": [
   {"issue": "No Margin Notice Deadline is fixed anywhere in Annex I or this Agreement, so the definition defaults to the deadline \"established in accordance with market practice,\" a standard the instrument nowhere describes. The timing of a margin call, and therefore whether a default under Paragraph 4 occurred, rests on that undefined market practice.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.30}
 ]},
